<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12458" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδημ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going</i> or <i>being abroad,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐξ οἴκου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.130
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				3.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cri.</u>
					52b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξω τῆς χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					949e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				950a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡ εἰς Ὀλυμπίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					4.30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῆς ἀ. τῆς ἐκεῖ</span>
			as to my <i>life in</i> that <i>foreign land,</i> i.e. beyond
			the grave, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				61e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				67c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ap.</u>
				41a
			</span></i> (but in pl. of earthly life, as <i>exile from</i> heaven,
				<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				5
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀποδημίας τινὸς
			προσῄει</span> from <i>a long journey,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
